{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026RPzOXt8lEc1792749339.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>歌手冼靖峰（Archie）將於2026年12月6日晚上8時15分，假麥花臣場館隆重舉行《冼靖峰ARCHIETECT LIVE IN HONG KONG》演唱會。</p><p></p><p>日前Archie以隨性態度拍攝演唱會海報，特別選擇在一張佈滿唱片、結他及電子琴的床上取景。他表示這張床代表著自己的家，皆因他平日在家大部份時間均與聽歌及練歌為伴，尤其半夜練歌時，更會在床上彈奏結他，因此海報畫面正正是他真實生活的縮影。他笑言觀眾12月入場觀賞其演出，就能同步體驗他在家中一天內所經歷的一切。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"05851331-15a7-4f73-86f4-863a7ca5cc98.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026EplGmjq1pI1792749341.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"e84ddc1c-8e29-46bf-84e0-bfd30467d9e3.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026XWhmTwGTCa1792749340.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>Archie相信今次演唱會的主題能為觀眾帶來新鮮感，而歌單編排亦會與早前的內地演唱會有所區分。他續指，12月6日演出當晚獲不少好友到場支持，當中甚至有身處外地的好友專程返港捧場。為了以最佳狀態登上舞台，Archie現已找來健身教練指導體能訓練，正全力朝著目標身型積極備戰。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T10:42:57.610399+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":371,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T09:54:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T13:15:29.885581+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T10:38:27.991536+00:00","content_hash":"75bd2b49a8018cf4f186ad4e136232c60d13c4dfd2128691cfa618a70d3db97a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}